      "content": "it just feels so futile. like i'm just waiting for a person who isn't coming back. if the consciousness is already gone, and there's no core 'self' left to actually experience anything... isn't it just kind of a logical mistake to keep pretending the body is still here? it feels like i'm just maintaining a facade for no reason.",
