      "content": "The feeling of futility is a heavy weight, but it's a symptom of your current distress, not an absolute truth about your existence. Even if the self feels absent right now, the capacity to feel, to seek relief, and to want to stop this pain is still very much present within you. A professional can help you explore these deep existential questions while providing immediate relief from the crushing weight of hopelessness. Please consider contacting a support service right now.",
